Subject: [PATCH] Add a per-track modulation matrix (Mod page) and mod wheel,
 expression and aftertouch sources

CC 1 becomes the live mod wheel (default: MODW to VIB on every synth engine); the LFO amount moves to CC 12.
The matrix is saved in the patterns stream (project format 14; older projects load with the default matrix).

